# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Vitest browser-mode artefacts (generated per run, never versioned)
.vitest-attachments/
tests/__screenshots__/

# Local, unversioned dev-server configuration
.claude/launch.json

# Source art brought in to annotate. It is INPUT, not source: it belongs to whoever drew it, it is
# reproducible from the URL recorded in each set's `source` block, and once inside git history it never
# leaves. The files this repository produces are versioned; the pixel art they describe is not.
art-in/

# Reference corpora cloned to exercise the tool — the Liberated Pixel Cup lives here.
#
# 🔴 THIS ONE IS NOT MERELY UNTIDY TO COMMIT, IT IS FORBIDDEN. The LPC is dual CC BY-SA 3.0 / GPL-3.0, and
# ADR-0133 admits share-alike through the bridge on one condition, in its own words: «nenhum ficheiro CC
# BY-SA entra tal e qual» — no such file enters as it is. Only an ADAPTATION crosses, carrying
# `GPL-3.0-only` as its outgoing licence. What this repository may version is what the tool PRODUCES from
# the art, never the art.
research/

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
